 -   **Performance**:
     -   On a $256 \times 256 \times 256$ aneurism dataset ($\gamma=0.3$), SnapMC produced 106,356 triangles in 1.52s, reducing triangle count by ~39% compared to Regular MC (175,832 triangles, 0.71s) [S2, unofficial].
